# Release Log — alice branch (changes from 0.1-alpha)

## bullet_app

1 commit, 1 file changed, +2 / -2 lines.

### Modified files

- `src/bullet_app/missions/target_hit.py`
  Attitude timestamp now uses `sample.attitude_at` instead of manually computing
  the offset from `timesync_status.offset_ns + time_boot_ms`. Removes the
  redundant `0 <=` lower bound check on attitude age, keeping only the max age
  guard.
